    "ssml": "<speak xmlns:mstts=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/mstts\" version=\"1.0\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis\" xml:lang=\"en-US\"><voice name=\"en-US-Harper:MAI-Voice-2.1\"><mstts:express-as style=\"audiobook\"><prosody rate=\"-12%\"><p>Maya takes a flashlight, and Tom takes some yellow cheese. They go to the big tree in the garden. Tom shines the flashlight under the roots. A little mouse comes out of a hole with a book in its little paws. “We have cheese. Do you have a key?” asks Tom. The mouse gives them a silver key, takes the cheese and disappears. Under the leaves, the children find an old door in the ground.</p></prosody></mstts:express-as></voice></speak>"
